id: cpc_ng_pm_runtime
package: cpc_ng
description: |
  CPC-NG runtime power management for a bus end. Enables local sleep policy
  (power mode, wake-in GPIO, runtime PM get/put) so the MCU may enter deep sleep
  when idle while still waking on peer traffic or GPIO.

  Install on any end that uses wake-in or driver runtime PM; configuration lives
  in the CPC driver instance headers.
category: Services|CPC-NG|Internal
quality: experimental
label: CPC-NG Runtime PM
provides:
- name: cpc_ng_pm_runtime
requires:
- name: cpc_ng_wake
- name: gpio
- name: power_manager
template_contribution:
- name: component_catalog
  value: cpc_ng_pm_runtime
root_path: cpc_ng
